# --- Python 构建/缓存 ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.dist/
.venv/
.env

# --- 测试/类型检查缓存 ---
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Agent / 工具运行时状态 ---
# pi 会话记录要跟着仓库在自有机器间同步，所以从 .pi/* 里放出来。
# 写 `.pi/*` 而不是 `.pi/`：被排除的目录无法再 ! 放行里面的东西。
.pi/*
!.pi/settings.json
!.pi/sessions
# workflow 运行状态：project_dir/Docs/ai-generation/workflow/state.json
# 只锚定仓库根目录，避免误伤 tests/fixtures/**/Docs/
/Docs/
output/
# demo-project 不再是脚手架，而是真实项目：设计产物（md/json/yaml）跟仓库走，
# 客户原始大文件（PRD PDF、原理图源文件、xlsx）不入库。
# 注意：被排除的**目录**无法再 ! 放行里面的东西，所以逐层先放行目录。
demo-project/*
!demo-project/Docs/
demo-project/Docs/*
!demo-project/Docs/config.yaml
!demo-project/Docs/standards/
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/
demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/**
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/fw-architecture/
demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/fw-architecture/**
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/fw-architecture/*.md
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/fw-architecture/*.mmd
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/fw-architecture/system-design/
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/fw-architecture/system-design/*.md
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/knowledge/
demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/knowledge/**
!demo-project/Docs/ai-generation/knowledge/requirements_index.json
*.log

# --- 调试产物（不是开发产物，随时可删）---
# 提示词日志 .epi/debug/prompt-journal/ 含 PRD 原文片段，且删掉不该影响任何功能。
.epi/

# --- 编辑器/系统杂项 ---
.DS_Store
